<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Letter from {{ payer }}</title>
<style>body{font-family:Georgia,serif;margin:2em}</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="page" data-page-no="1">
  <p>{{ request_date }}</p>
  <p>To: {{ seller }}, {{ seller_address }}</p>
  <p>From: {{ payer }}</p>
  <p>Re: invoice {{ invoice_id }}, {{ quantity }} x {{ description }}</p>
  <p>Our new distribution site is not ready to receive stock.</p>
  <p>{{ hold_until_line }}</p>
  <p>We have inspected and accept the goods, and title passes to us on the invoice date.</p>
  <p>We will arrange collection with our own carrier.</p>
</section>
</body>
</html>
